> ABC Aesthetics & Wellness

Personalized medical aesthetics and wellness care in Lake Oswego, Oregon,
from Dr. Nawal M. Qneibi, DNP-BC. Treatment selection is individualized
following consultation and clinical assessment, and individual results vary.

## About

- Practice: ABC Aesthetics & Wellness (legal entity: ABC Aesthetics LLC)
- Founded: 2023, by Dr. Nawal M. Qneibi, DNP-BC
- Location: 16240 Parker Road, Lake Oswego, Oregon
- Phone: 971-978-7840
- Email: info@abcaestheticsllc.com
- Hours: Monday–Friday 9:00 AM – 6:00 PM; Saturday–Sunday 10:00 AM – 6:00 PM.
  By appointment only. Hours may be updated as the practice schedule changes.

## Treatments

- [Aesthetic Injectables](https://abcaestheticsllc.com/injectables/): neuromodulators, dermal fillers and biostimulators, selected by treatment area, facial anatomy and your goals following consultation.
- [Advanced Skin & Energy-Based Treatments](https://abcaestheticsllc.com/skin-energy/): non-invasive and minimally invasive treatments for skin tone, texture and firmness — SkinPen microneedling, SkinSmooth and Sofwave.
- [Regenerative Aesthetics](https://abcaestheticsllc.com/regenerative-aesthetics/): biologic treatments using your own platelets, with collagen-stimulating injectables, to support volume, texture and skin quality.
- [Hair Restoration & Hair Rejuvenation](https://abcaestheticsllc.com/hair-restoration/): personalized hair-loss plans built after assessment of your hair-loss pattern and clinical history, with regenerative options where appropriate.
- [Hormone, Metabolic Health & Wellness](https://abcaestheticsllc.com/hormone-metabolic-wellness/): hormone balance, metabolic health and medical weight management through individualized therapy, clinical evaluation and ongoing review.
- [Women's Wellness](https://abcaestheticsllc.com/womens-wellness/): individualized care supporting hormonal, menopausal and sexual wellness.
- [Men's Wellness](https://abcaestheticsllc.com/mens-wellness/): personalized care for men's hormonal, sexual and quality-of-life goals, including testosterone replacement therapy and the P-Shot.
- [Sexual Wellness](https://abcaestheticsllc.com/sexual-wellness/): individualized sexual wellness care in a professional, private and respectful setting. Suitability is determined following evaluation.
- [Wellness Products](https://abcaestheticsllc.com/wellness-products/): medical-grade wellness products selected as part of an individualized plan.

